{"id":32,"titleZh":"音乐原子：音程研究","titleEn":"Musical Atoms: A Study of Interval","date":"1965-11-29","dateZh":"1965 年 11 月 29 日","concepts":"音程距离、八度十二半音、9 的转位法则","thesis":"单独一个音还构不成音乐，两个音之间的距离（音程）才产生最初的张力；所有复杂的交响曲都是音程按比例搭出来的。","plain":"音程就是两个音高之间的距离，两个音横着依次响是旋律，竖着同时响是和声。难懂的“音程转位”其实只要用 9 去减就记牢（二度翻过来变七度，三度翻过来变六度，四度变五度）；最小的小二度挤在一起摩擦，大二度则能带来开阔的解决感。","scenes":["请新任长笛首席朱利叶斯·贝克依次只吹一个长音（没变化）、两个音（产生张力）和三个音（直接变成《蓝色多瑙河》）；又现场拉开一根物理卷尺，以每英尺 12 英寸直观类比“一个八度包含 12 个半音”。","先带动全厅观众和单簧管、圆号、弦乐逐一合唱完二度到八度全部音程，随后直接在钢琴上连弹同一组下行音切换下面和弦，示范“从披头士的《Help!》无缝切入勃拉姆斯与沃恩-威廉斯交响曲”。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1sE411a7rz","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sE411a7rz","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐的原子：音程研究","duration":"54:46","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/musical-atoms","repertoire":[{"composer":"Wagner","piece":"Prelude to Act III of Lohengrin","titleZh":"罗恩格林第三幕前奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wagner%20Prelude%20to%20Act%20III%20of%20Lohengrin+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Wagner%20Prelude%20to%20Act%20III%20of%20Lohengrin"},{"composer":"Johann Strauss II","piece":"The Blue Danube Waltz","titleZh":"蓝色多瑙河","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Johann%20Strauss%20II%20The%20Blue%20Danube%20Waltz+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Johann%20Strauss%20II%20The%20Blue%20Danube%20Waltz"},{"composer":"The Beatles","piece":"Help!","titleZh":"救命！","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/90/c1/c1/90c1c133-02e3-255d-3a0d-e70c5a404bc5/mzaf_14127376946151186172.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/help/1441164524?i=1441164536&uo=4","recordingArtis